      "date_raw": "Thu, 25 Feb 2021 11:49:15 -0500",
      "body": "On Thu, Feb 25, 2021, Rafał Bachorz wrote:\n>\n>Thus I do have a doubts:\n>* is it feasible to build Amber18 with AmberTools20?\nI would not recommend this.\n>* if not, is it possible to download sources of AmberTools18 or AmberTools19?\nGo here:  https://ambermd.org/downloads/AmberTools18.tar.bz2\nBut, assuming you get pmemd compiled, set you AMBERHOME to Amber20, and\njust use pmemd from Amber18.  (pmemd does not care what the AMBERHOME\nvariable is.)\n....dac",
